    "name": "Red Core Division",
    "steam_appid": 3629570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/2d0af38e4c90173a8c6d59c6855de104.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Core Division</strong> is a co-op survival horror game for 1\u20134 players. Your mission: infiltrate a top-secret containment zone where the line between reality and nightmare has broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unspeakable horrors, complete deadly objectives, and uncover the truth hidden across three distinct, chilling locations. But beware\u2014something ancient and violent lurks in the shadows\u2026 and it\u2019s hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/411519a77f4856ec7740d6ccd7552136.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/411519a77f4856ec7740d6ccd7552136.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/411519a77f4856ec7740d6ccd7552136.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/e4202b38c89f74fbf3c9c6a19aa9663c.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From creaking suburban homes and abandoned hospitals to pitch-black industrial corridors\u2014you\u2019ll explore a variety of terrifying environments, each with unique objectives, layouts, and horrors waiting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run throws you into a new scenario, forcing your team to adapt, survive, and escape... if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/c43c1982e55786a6bf36564bb29179e7.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/c43c1982e55786a6bf36564bb29179e7.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/c43c1982e55786a6bf36564bb29179e7.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/9a6f9e59d34dc3c0c19ee561049e7b41.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity voice chat to stay in touch with your squad\u2026 if you dare. The creatures that stalk these halls are drawn to sound. A single word might reveal your location. Silence can be safety\u2014or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every footstep, every breath, every moment counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/4b39c2a2bd85b65b5cd2e8f6585f8ddf.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/4b39c2a2bd85b65b5cd2e8f6585f8ddf.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/4b39c2a2bd85b65b5cd2e8f6585f8ddf.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/39a511ee7147afb5a5b88e337bb2e437.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to investigate paranormal zones, gather crucial evidence, and survive long enough to exfil. Each mission is packed with high-stakes tasks, randomized events, and shifting threats that force your team to adapt\u2014or fall apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ae9c25346eaedaf70a5d927e91aa0b78.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ae9c25346eaedaf70a5d927e91aa0b78.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ae9c25346eaedaf70a5d927e91aa0b78.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/dd63b370210cb0d289fc7862915d2a7c.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about jumpscares. Red Core Division features dynamic enemies that react to player behavior, environment, and noise. Hide, run, or fight\u2014but every encounter is a test of your nerves and your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re not just looking for you. They\u2019re hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ebdc80f15ee6ab82cb9fad6781e19ff9.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ebdc80f15ee6ab82cb9fad6781e19ff9.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ebdc80f15ee6ab82cb9fad6781e19ff9.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/2d0af38e4c90173a8c6d59c6855de104.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Core Division</strong> is a co-op survival horror game for 1\u20134 players. Your mission: infiltrate a top-secret containment zone where the line between reality and nightmare has broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unspeakable horrors, complete deadly objectives, and uncover the truth hidden across three distinct, chilling locations. But beware\u2014something ancient and violent lurks in the shadows\u2026 and it\u2019s hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/411519a77f4856ec7740d6ccd7552136.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/411519a77f4856ec7740d6ccd7552136.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/411519a77f4856ec7740d6ccd7552136.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/e4202b38c89f74fbf3c9c6a19aa9663c.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From creaking suburban homes and abandoned hospitals to pitch-black industrial corridors\u2014you\u2019ll explore a variety of terrifying environments, each with unique objectives, layouts, and horrors waiting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run throws you into a new scenario, forcing your team to adapt, survive, and escape... if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/c43c1982e55786a6bf36564bb29179e7.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/c43c1982e55786a6bf36564bb29179e7.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/c43c1982e55786a6bf36564bb29179e7.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/9a6f9e59d34dc3c0c19ee561049e7b41.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity voice chat to stay in touch with your squad\u2026 if you dare. The creatures that stalk these halls are drawn to sound. A single word might reveal your location. Silence can be safety\u2014or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every footstep, every breath, every moment counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/4b39c2a2bd85b65b5cd2e8f6585f8ddf.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/4b39c2a2bd85b65b5cd2e8f6585f8ddf.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/4b39c2a2bd85b65b5cd2e8f6585f8ddf.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/39a511ee7147afb5a5b88e337bb2e437.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to investigate paranormal zones, gather crucial evidence, and survive long enough to exfil. Each mission is packed with high-stakes tasks, randomized events, and shifting threats that force your team to adapt\u2014or fall apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ae9c25346eaedaf70a5d927e91aa0b78.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ae9c25346eaedaf70a5d927e91aa0b78.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ae9c25346eaedaf70a5d927e91aa0b78.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/dd63b370210cb0d289fc7862915d2a7c.avif?t=1752420486\" width=614 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about jumpscares. Red Core Division features dynamic enemies that react to player behavior, environment, and noise. Hide, run, or fight\u2014but every encounter is a test of your nerves and your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re not just looking for you. They\u2019re hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ebdc80f15ee6ab82cb9fad6781e19ff9.poster.avif?t=1752420486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ebdc80f15ee6ab82cb9fad6781e19ff9.webm?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629570/extras/ebdc80f15ee6ab82cb9fad6781e19ff9.mp4?t=1752420486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
